      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've seen a bunch of other bug reports about this. \n\nAs a PCVR, I appreciate the hard work VRChat has been putting into \"stop quest users from crashing every 5 minutes\". It's not perfect, I was with a friend in a public world and it took 20 mins for my avi to load.\n\nThey might need to more aggressively unload stuff that isn't used, but doing that might be adding stutters.\n\nMostly just writing to say that they're still working on this, and I've observed that VRC only spends so much time reassuring people that they actually do dev work :)",
