  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "This just happens constantly by trying to load someone's avatar, even if it happens randomly, it is very common, the avatars will be stuck for maybe 20 minutes if not longer trying to load, but they will not load and no matter what i did myself they dont load properly, i messed with the custom shields to disable particles, rejoined, turned on and off avatars, rejoined the instance and they do not load, and yes i did tried to clean my vrchat cache if that was the problem but same results",
